# Root build-context ignore — the shared deny-list for the api, web, and worker images.
# BuildKit uses this whenever a build has no <Dockerfile>.dockerignore of its own.
# The statics image is the exception: deploy/statics.Dockerfile.dockerignore is an allow-list
# (it needs apps/docs + storybook-static, which this file excludes) and therefore overrides this.

# Never copy host installs or build artifacts into the image —
# each builder stage produces its own via pnpm install + turbo build (incl. a fresh .output).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.output
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
# Prisma Client is generated inside the image by packages/db postinstall — never ship the host copy.
# (Harmless for images that don't use Prisma: nothing matches.)
**/generated

# Secrets must never enter a build context (they would persist in image layers).
.env
.env.*

# Irrelevant to image builds — keeps the context small and the cache stable.
.git
.github
.claude
.husky
.vscode
apps/docs
